RaiseSteady Guard was made with AI: its code was written by an AI assistant and checked with automated tests. No independent expert has audited it. It is provided "as is", without any guarantee or warranty of any kind, to the extent permitted by law. It does not guarantee that every unsuitable site is blocked, that its limits cannot be got round, or that it works on every PC. Nexodyne Limited and the contributors take no responsibility for any loss or damage from installing or using it, to the extent permitted by law. Support is voluntary, and it may not get updates. No filter is perfect: stay close to your child.\par
